chapter.v:
you are 


indeed wiser, 


than Daniel; no secret is hidden from you;

by your 


wisdom and, 


your understanding you have made wealth for yourself, and have gathered gold and silver into your treasuries;

and say, 


Thus says, 


the Lord GOD: “Behold, I am against you, O Sidon, and I will manifest my glory in your midst. And they shall know that I am the LORD when I execute judgments in her and manifest my holiness in her;
